===Etymology===
From {{ON.|nl}} ''[[bœr]]'' (farm)

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Nl-boer.ogg|audio}}

===Noun===
{{nl-noun|g=m|boeren|boertje}}

# [[farmer]], [[peasant]]
# [[boor]], ruffian, yokel etc.
# '''-boer''' (''in compounds'') [[merchant]] (and sometimes producer) of a certain product group, mainly foods, often named after it, e.g. [[melkboer]] 'milkman'
# [[jack]] (playing cards)

